Cell["2. Matching", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"a1308d1c-8718-724a-bc8f-6f4fc67a466b"],

Cell["\<\
Before anything is rewritten, the input has to be found. \
HypergraphRuleMatches gives the ways it sits inside a hypergraph, and nothing \
else:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a2396405-c896-c141-9cdc-dbf07113d31f"],

