\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"51d6d567-6ccb-a144-87c8-11bbb713c534"],

Cell["\<\
{#[\"NewVertices\"], VertexList[#[\"Hypergraph\"]]} & @ First[sub[chain]]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"7793d84f-586e-ea45-bece-69dcc390c82b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\[FormalV]", "[", "1", "]"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Vertex", "[", "1", "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Vertex", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Vertex", "[", "3", "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Vertex", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[FormalV]", "[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], 
  "}"}]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"416a46ca-2909-5749-a362-4635906b572c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Design note.  ",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "Fresh symbols would do here, and are what the reference uses, but names \
chosen to avoid what is present make a rewrite reproducible from one session \
to the next. That matters as soon as states are compared, which is the whole \
of what a multiway system does."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{2, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameMargins->{{10, 0}, {6, 6}},
 CellFrameColor->GrayLevel[0.7],
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.25],ExpressionUUID->"a0af55b7-f9a8-2240-b886-628450e07059"],

Cell["4. Labels", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"a979b098-f5a6-4640-b840-4755a6ab3250"],

Cell["\<\
Labels on a rule constrain what it applies to. A pattern carrying no label \
matches whatever it lies on, and one carrying a label matches only the same \
label, so labels only ever narrow a rule.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d516d452-8400-d24e-8490-82eec2bbbdd9"],

Cell["\<\
labelled = Hypergraph[{Edge[{1, 2}, \"Directed\", \"a\"], Edge[{2, 3}, \
\"Directed\", \"b\"]}]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"52bf9a70-d566-ae4e-983f-67fc265ae26b"],

